        {
          "text": "Te ’ba alu indi agu Benyamini­niri,runi Kisi’i,Abieli mvi,Abieli mvi Zerorini, Zerori mvi Bekoratini, Bekorati mvi Afiani, eri ovu mvi agu Benyamininiri, ’ba ambo afa e’iru; ",
