        {
          "text": "eri ovu agupimva be, ru erini Saulo’i, eri karilau ndrizani. Anzi Israelini ma eselia ’ba eri agapi ndrizasi rani yo; budri erini pi dri erini be eri aga ’ba azini ’diyi dria ra zozasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
